+The guard regions `N<=0`, `N=1`, `N=2`, `N=3`, and `N>=4` are exhaustive and
+pairwise disjoint over K integers. No priority, overlap, unguarded
+totalization, simplification, concrete-only rule, opaque symbol, or operational
